    "body": "<div class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"col-inner\">\n            \n                  <div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-12\">\n                      <div class=\"col-inner\">\n                        <strong>DailyApps</strong> is an enterprise\n                        &ldquo;super-app&rdquo; for XEFI field teams — a single\n                        authenticated portal that bundles 13+ specialised modules\n                        for daily operations: field interventions, attendance,\n                        leave, carpooling, expenses, payslips, sales performance,\n                        surveys and a company directory.\n\n                        <br /><br />\n                        Built with Flutter on a modular, domain-driven\n                        architecture, DailyApps is offline-first (Hive plus\n                        encrypted SQLite), supports multi-environment builds and\n                        ships hot-patches through Shorebird without an app-store\n                        re-submission.\n\n                        <br /><br />\n                        Each module is a self-contained mini-app behind one login.\n                        <strong>Bon-Inter</strong> lets field technicians plan and\n                        track interventions with geolocation, client profiles,\n                        equipment inventory and on-site survey forms;\n                        <strong>Émargement</strong> handles event attendance with\n                        QR check-in/out and captured signatures;\n                        <strong>Congés</strong> runs leave requests through an\n                        approval workflow and shared planning calendar; and\n                        <strong>Covoit</strong> matches carpools with maps, saved\n                        home/work locations and rider messaging.\n\n                        <br /><br />\n                        The suite also covers back-office and commercial needs:\n                        <strong>NDF</strong> captures and validates expenses with\n                        ML-assisted document scanning, <strong>Livret</strong>\n                        delivers payslips and HR documents electronically,\n                        <strong>SalesUp</strong> gives sales teams live metrics and\n                        bonus tracking, the <strong>questionnaire</strong> builder\n                        supports conditional logic and offline responses, and a\n                        company <strong>directory</strong> adds team lookup with\n                        caller-ID integration.\n\n                        <br /><br />\n                        Everything sits on a shared foundation: secure\n                        authentication through XEFI's global login kit with\n                        role-based access, real-time push notifications via\n                        Firebase, offline-first local storage, computer-vision\n                        tooling (QR and document scanning), and Sentry monitoring —\n                        engineered so field teams can keep working even with\n                        unreliable connectivity.\n\n                        <br /><br />\n                        Key features:\n                        <ul>\n                          <li>Bon-Inter — plan and track field interventions with geolocation &amp; client profiles</li>\n                          <li>Émargement — QR check-in / check-out with signature capture</li>\n                          <li>Congés — leave requests &amp; approval workflow</li>\n                          <li>Covoit — carpool matching with maps &amp; chat</li>\n                          <li>NDF — expense capture with ML document scanning</li>\n                          <li>Livret — digital payslip delivery</li>\n                          <li>SalesUp — sales metrics &amp; bonus tracking</li>\n                          <li>Questionnaires with conditional logic &amp; offline responses</li>\n                          <li>Company directory with caller-ID</li>\n                          <li>Secure SSO login, push notifications and Sentry monitoring</li>\n                        </ul>\n\n\n                        <br />\n                        DailyApps is distributed internally as an enterprise app\n                        for XEFI teams — it is not published on the public app\n                        stores.\n\n                        <br /><br />\n                        <div style=\"background: #1e293b; color: #f8fafc; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; border-left: 5px solid #3b82f6; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 20px;\">\n                          <i class=\"fas fa-info-circle\" style=\"margin-right: 10px; color: #60a5fa;\"></i>\n                          If you need a demo access account, please contact me on my email <a href=\"mailto:contact@farhaan.info\" style=\"color: #60a5fa; text-decoration: underline;\">contact@farhaan.info</a>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>"
